  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT FAQs\n\n### Adding Clients in MTD IT and My Admin\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 18 Mar, 2026 at 12:16 PM\n\n\t\tThe MTD IT module does not automatically pick up newly created clients from MY ADMIN yet.\n\nExisting clients may appear in MTD IT only if they were previously used (e.g., for Self Assessment or earlier workflows).\n\nImportant note on duplicates:In future, when the client import from MY ADMIN to MTD IT is enabled, if you’ve already manually added the same client in MTD IT, it may show as a duplicate in the list.What you should do now:\n\nAdd new clients in MY ADMIN Then manually create them again in MTD IT (for now) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000202221\">MTD IT FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Adding Clients in MTD IT and My Admin\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 18 Mar, 2026 at 12:16 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MailCompose\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The MTD IT module does not automatically pick up newly created clients from MY ADMIN yet.<br><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Existing clients may appear in MTD IT only if they were previously used (e.g., for Self Assessment or earlier workflows).<br><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><u>Important note on duplicates:</u></strong></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In future, when the client import from MY ADMIN to MTD IT is enabled, if you’ve already manually added the same client in MTD IT, it may show as a duplicate in the list.</div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What you should do now:<br><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Add new clients in MY ADMIN </div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Display&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;, &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Then manually create them again in MTD IT (for now) </div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000275345\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000275345/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000275345\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-contain